" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="2" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="35"></div> <div class="lottie lo02" data-w-id="9f8c86d3-d3c2-1465-cb72-d49208925fd1" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="/documents/3ctAxHM6aH.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="-1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="2" data-loading="eager"></div> </div> </div> <div class="roadmap-dropdown"> <p class="roadmap_text">Initial research began with scaling.   “Bitcoin” fork to discover realistic upper bound.  Multiple optimizations &amp; improvements implemented.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="roadmap_item"> <div class="roadmap_title-heading"> <div class="roadmap_title2"></div> <div class="roadmap_year">2013</div> </div> <div id="w-node-_9f96d9a9-44e1-3bb6-3622-6ed88a84521e-ef7f8bf5" class="roadmap_line-wrapp"> <div class="roadmap_circle"></div> </div> <div class="roadmap_content-wrapper"> <div data-w-id="50f54a11-2fd4-f45c-054a-f1114249c306" class="roadmap-linkk-02"> <div class="roadmap_subtitle rs02">Block Trees</div> <div class="lottie02"> <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="lottie" data-w-id="50f54a11-2fd4-f45c-054a-f1114249c30a" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="/documents/owLIrZEPLH.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="2" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="35"></div> <div class="lottie lo02" data-w-id="50f54a11-2fd4-f45c-054a-f1114249c30b" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="/documents/3ctAxHM6aH.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="2" data-loading="eager"></div> </div> </div> <div style="height:0px" class="roadmap-dropdown"> <p class="roadmap_text">A “tree of block chains” which allows concurrent transaction processing with delayed reconciliation of state.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="roadmap_item"> <div class="roadmap_title-heading"> <div class="roadmap_title2"> <div class="roadmap_title">~2,000 TPS</div> <div class="roadmap_chart _3"></div> </div> <div class="roadmap_year">2014</div> </div> <div id="w-node-_9f96d9a9-44e1-3bb6-3622-6ed88a845231-ef7f8bf5" class="roadmap_line-wrapp"> <div class="roadmap_circle"></div> </div> <div class="roadmap_content-wrapper"> <div data-w-id="1a163a22-901a-d4cc-f151-f23656958730" class="roadmap-linkk-02"> <div class="roadmap_subtitle rs02">DAGs</div> <div class="lottie02"> <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="lottie" data-w-id="1a163a22-901a-d4cc-f151-f23656958734" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="/documents/owLIrZEPLH.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="2" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="35"></div> <div class="lottie lo02" data-w-id="1a163a22-901a-d4cc-f151-f23656958735" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="/documents/3ctAxHM6aH.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="2" data-loading="eager"></div> </div> </div> <div style="height:0px" class="roadmap-dropdown"> <p class="roadmap_text">First “Visa scale” iteration. DAGs allow easy sharding, low messaging overheads, and responsiveness.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="roadmap_item"> <div class="roadmap_title-heading"> <div class="roadmap_title2"> <div class="roadmap_title">~2,500 TPS</div> <div class="roadmap_chart _04"></div> </div> <div class="roadmap_year">2017</div> </div> <div id="w-node-_9f96d9a9-44e1-3bb6-3622-6ed88a845244-ef7f8bf5" class="roadmap_line-wrapp"> <div class="roadmap_circle"></div> </div> <div class="roadmap_content-wrapper"> <div data-w-id="49d3f4ae-1c90-4800-f9d2-fea526a34bf3" class="roadmap-linkk-02"> <div class="roadmap_subtitle rs02">CAST</div> <div class="lottie02"> <div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="lottie" data-w-id="49d3f4ae-1c90-4800-f9d2-fea526a34bf7" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="/documents/owLIrZEPLH.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="2" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="35"></div> <div class="lottie lo02" data-w-id="49d3f4ae-1c90-4800-f9d2-fea526a34bf8" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="/documents/3ctAxHM6aH.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="1" data-is-ix2-target="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="2" data-loading="eager"></div> </div> </div> <div style="height:0px" class="roadmap-dropdown"> <p class="roadmap_text">Splitting state &amp; transactional data allowed better management of messaging overheads and security (double spends).</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="roadmap_item"> <div class="roadmap_title-heading"> <div class="roadmap_title2"> <div class="roadmap_title">1,400,000 TPS</div> <div class="roadmap_chart _05"></div> </div> <div class="roadmap_year">2020</div> </div> <div id="w-node-_80565e39-3532-9a67-7aaf-6ffb9b4e5750-ef7f8bf5" class="roadmap_line-wrapp"> <div class="roadmap_circle"></div> </div> <div class="roadmap_content-wrapper"> <a href="https://www.radixdlt.com/blog/replaying-bitcoin" target="_blank" class="roadmap-linkk w-inline-block"> <div class="roadmap_subtitle rs02">Tempo</div> <div class="arrows"><img src="/images/vector-15.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="imgarrows ia-02"><img src="/images/vector-14.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="imgarrows"></div> </a> <p class="roadmap_text">A complete reimagination of state representation &amp; sharding design to minimize overheads of processing &amp; reconciliation.</p> </div> </div> <div class="roadmap_item"> <div class="roadmap_title-heading"> <div class="roadmap_title2"> <div class="roadmap_title2"> <div class="roadmap_title">Unlimited TPS</div> </div> </div> <div class="roadmap_year">2020 onwards</div> </div> <div id="w-node-_9f96d9a9-44e1-3bb6-3622-6ed88a845254-ef7f8bf5" class="roadmap_line-wrapp"> <div class="roadmap_circle"></div> </div> <div class="roadmap_content-wrapper"> <a href="https://www.radixdlt.com/blog/cerberus-infographic-series-chapter-i" target="_blank" class="roadmap-linkk w-inline-block"> <div class="roadmap_subtitle rs02">Cerberus</div> <div class="arrows"><img src="/images/vector-15.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="imgarrows ia-02"><img src="/images/vector-14.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="imgarrows"></div> </a> <p class="roadmap_text">Cerberus’ complementary consensus mechanism allows for “cross-shard” communication which preserves all other desirable properties of security &amp; communication overheads.</p> </div><img src="/images/Rectangle-153.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="scale-bg"> </div> <div class="roadmap_item"> <div class="roadmap_title-heading"> <div class="roadmap_title2"> <div class="roadmap_title2"></div> </div> <div class="roadmap_year">2022</div> </div> <div id="w-node-ea44deb8-2228-d4fb-efdb-887354dbe0b0-ef7f8bf5" class="roadmap_line-wrapp"> <div class="roadmap_circle"></div> </div> <div class="roadmap_content-wrapper"> <a href="https://www.radixdlt.com/blog/radix-olympia-mainnet-is-here" target="_blank" class="roadmap-linkk w-inline-block"> <div class="roadmap_subtitle rs02">Olympia</div> <div class="arrows"><img src="/images/vector-15.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="imgarrows ia-02"><img src="/images/vector-14.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="imgarrows"></div> </a> <div class="roadmap_subtitle _03">Atomic &amp; Composable</div> <p class="roadmap_text">An initial, MVP, un-sharded launch of the Radix network using a hybrid of Hotstuff + Cerberus consensus.</p> </div> </div> <div class="roadmap_item"> <div class="roadmap_title-heading"> <div class="roadmap_title2"> <div class="roadmap_title2"></div> </div> <div class="roadmap_year">2023 - Present</div> </div> <div id="w-node-_9f96d9a9-44e1-3bb6-3622-6ed88a845262-ef7f8bf5" class="roadmap_line-wrapp"> <div class="roadmap_circle linear"></div> </div> <div class="roadmap_content-wrapper rcw-slast"> <a href="https://www.radixdlt.com/blog/babylon-mainnet-upgrade-complete" target="_blank" class="roadmap-linkk w-inline-block"> <div class="roadmap_subtitle rs02">Babylon</div> <div class="arrows"><img src="/images/vector-15.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="imgarrows ia-02"><img src="/images/vector-14.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="imgarrows"></div> </a> <div class="roadmap_subtitle _03">Smart Contracts &amp; 2 Mil Public Test</div> <p class="roadmap_text">The currently launched iteration of the network which brought secure, efficient dApps &amp; smart contracts via Scrypto along with an integrated user experience.</p> </div> </div> <div class="roadmap_line"></div> <div class="roadmap_item ri-last"> <div class="roadmap_title-heading rth-last"> <div class="div-block"> <div class="roadmap_last-title">Hyperscale</div> </div> <div class="roadmap_year">2027</div> </div> <div id="w-node-ac890bdf-35bd-1ec7-9e98-415c1d591a05-ef7f8bf5" class="roadmap_line-wrapp rlw-last"> <div class="roadmap_circle"></div> </div> <div class="roadmap_content-wrapper rcw-last"> <a href="#" class="roadmap-linkk w-inline-block"> <div class="roadmap_subtitle rs02">Cassandra + Cerberus - Xi&#x27;an</div> <div class="arrows"><img src="/images/vector-15.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="imgarrows ia-02"><img src="/images/vector-14.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="imgarrows"></div> </a> <div class="roadmap_subtitle _03">Linear Scalability &amp; No Limit in TPS</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cta-wrap"> <div class="content-inner"> <h2 class="h2cta">Want to know more? Check out the Roadmap to Hyperscale</h2> <a data-w-id="5d39d6b1-3fd2-2383-5a48-c1a485df0d27" href="https://www.radixdlt.com/blog/radix-labs-roadmap---to-hyperscale-and-beyond" target="_blank" class="navbar-button cta w-inline-block"> <div class="hero_button2 inside i02pink cta"> <div style="color:rgb(255,255,255)" class="text-block-18">See the Roadmap</div> <div style="filter:invert(0%)" class="code-embed w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="7" height="11" viewbox="0 0 7 11" fill="none"> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M3.29289 5.50008L0 2.20718L1.41421 0.792969L6.12132 5.50008L1.41421 10.2072L0 8.79297L3.29289 5.50008Z" fill="currentColor"></path> </svg></div> </div> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="bg-black"> <section class="section-hyperscale"> <div class="padding-global"> <div class="container-medium road"> <div class="roadmap_content"> <div class="roadmap_line rl02"></div> <div class="roadmap_item ri-last"> <div class="roadmap_title-heading rth-last"> <div class="div-block"> <div class="roadmap_last-title">Hyperscale</div> </div> <div class="roadmap_year">2027</div> </div> <div id="w-node-_062ea257-9de1-dd45-00ea-0a09a8a9a267-ef7f8bf5" class="roadmap_line-wrapp rlw-last"> <div class="roadmap_circle"></div> </div> <div class="roadmap_content-wrapper rcw-last"> <a href="#" class="roadmap-linkk w-inline-block"> <div class="roadmap_subtitle rs02">Cassandra + Cerberus - Xi&#x27;an</div> <div class="arrows"><img src="/images/vector-15.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="imgarrows ia-02"><img src="/images/vector-14.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="imgarrows"></div> </a> <div class="roadmap_subtitle _03">Linear Scalability &amp; No Limit in TPS</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cta-wrap"> <div class="content-inner"> <h2 class="h2cta">Want to know more? Check out the Roadmap to Hyperscale</h2> <a data-w-id="02f9b2e9-b4d5-3fc6-8996-2387010c057a" href="https://www.radixdlt.com/blog/radix-labs-roadmap---to-hyperscale-and-beyond" target="_blank" class="navbar-button w-inline-block"> <div style="background-color:rgb(206,11,152)" class="hero_button2 inside i02pink"> <div style="color:rgb(255,255,255)" class="text-block-18">See the Roadmap</div> <div style="filter:invert(0%)" class="code-embed w-embed"><svg xml